# Monorepo build

- Release artifacts come from `packages/free` and `packages/pro` via `@bin/build-zips.sh`.
- Zip layout: single top-level folder `credential-vault/` or `credential-vault-pro/` inside each archive under `dist/`.
- Local dev: root `@credential-vault.php` loads free; `npm run link` symlinks packages into `wp-content/plugins/credential-vault` and `credential-vault-pro`.
- Do not treat `dist/` or `.build/` as source—staging only.
